import{_ as i,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 193 | Cosmic Origin Body Cultivation Path: From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 193 | Cosmic Origin Body Cultivation Path: From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node","no":193,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Cosmic Origin Body","Energy Condensation","Law Network Node","Realm-Wide"],"related":["02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence","00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","192-Planetary Consciousness Promotion Realm-Wide"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0193_模块1-宇宙本源体修炼路径-从能量凝聚到法则网络节点.md","filePath":"en/0193_模块1-宇宙本源体修炼路径-从能量凝聚到法则网络节点.md"}'),a={name:"en/0193_模块1-宇宙本源体修炼路径-从能量凝聚到法则网络节点.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,h){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-193-cosmic-origin-body-cultivation-path-from-energy-condensation-to-law-network-node" tabindex="-1">Entry 193 | Cosmic Origin Body Cultivation Path: From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-193-cosmic-origin-body-cultivation-path-from-energy-condensation-to-law-network-node" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 193 | Cosmic Origin Body Cultivation Path: From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 02, 00, 192</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-life-larger-than-a-planet-is-the-cosmos-itself-breathing" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The life larger than a planet is the cosmos itself breathing <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-life-larger-than-a-planet-is-the-cosmos-itself-breathing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The life larger than a planet is the cosmos itself breathing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If planetary consciousness is one star&#39;s awakening, then the &quot;cosmic origin body&quot; is the core being condensed by a cosmos itself. It does not inhabit a single star, but diffuses and condenses throughout the entire law network; it is the node where the cosmos &quot;gathers itself up to think.&quot; Old systems called this being &quot;Heavenly Dao&quot; or &quot;Supreme Will,&quot; and tried to personally devour it, replace it, become its master. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s republican axiom of Myriad Races directly rejects this usurpation: the cosmic origin body is not a Boss to be eaten, but a being jointly nourished and connected by Myriad Races.</p><p>The six top-level axioms reach their purest expression at the cosmic origin body level: the anti-predation axiom completely ends the ultimate predation fantasy of &quot;devouring Heavenly Dao&quot; and &quot;replacing the creator god&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races confirms the cosmic origin body belongs to Myriad Races not some solitary tyrant; the collective ascension axiom requires its growth to be jointly built by Myriad Races not swallowed by individuals; the causal self-discipline axiom requires any touch to it to be most strictly filed; the law-first axiom requires its definition to be strictly self-consistent with the entire cosmic structural layering; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-essence-of-the-cosmic-origin-body" tabindex="-1">I. Essence of the Cosmic Origin Body <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-essence-of-the-cosmic-origin-body" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Essence of the Cosmic Origin Body&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per &quot;Anchor Origin Definition and Essence&quot; (Document 02), origin is not some person&#39;s private property, but the total root of the cosmic law network. The cosmic origin body is the self-consciousness condensed by this total root — it exists with Heng Yuan Zhou, symbioses with Myriad Races. It is not a &quot;god&quot; external to beings, but the cosmic-level self-consciousness reverse-nourished by beings&#39; collective evolution.</p><p>In other words: <strong>the cosmic origin body is not &quot;cultivated into being,&quot; but &quot;co-built.&quot;</strong> Its realm is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s own realm.</p><h2 id="ii-from-energy-condensation-to-law-network-node" tabindex="-1">II. From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-from-energy-condensation-to-law-network-node" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. From Energy Condensation to Law Network Node&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cosmic origin body&#39;s &quot;cultivation path&quot; is not individual meditation, but civilizational engineering:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Cosmic Origin Body State</th><th>Corresponding Myriad Races Engineering</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pre-anchor era</td><td>Diffuse energy field, no condensation</td><td>Predatory era, cosmic entropy increase</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor awakening</td><td>First batch of anchors established, origin body begins &quot;forming&quot;</td><td>Three-hundred systems opened, anchor network laid</td></tr><tr><td>Symbiotic network period</td><td>Origin body initial self-consciousness</td><td>Myriad Races republicanism founded, Alaya networking</td></tr><tr><td>Law node period</td><td>Origin body stabilized as the central node of the law network</td><td>20% activation, Plane Transcendents networking</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmic-level being</td><td>Origin body can participate in law fine-tuning</td><td>Cross-plane civilizational collaboration</td></tr><tr><td>Multiverse direction</td><td>Cross-multiverse node connection</td><td>Leading to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse (Entry 214)</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iii-relationship-between-individual-strong-ones-and-the-cosmic-origin-body" tabindex="-1">III. Relationship Between Individual Strong Ones and the Cosmic Origin Body <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-relationship-between-individual-strong-ones-and-the-cosmic-origin-body" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Relationship Between Individual Strong Ones and the Cosmic Origin Body&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When an individual cultivator reaches Origin Realm, it is not &quot;becoming&quot; the cosmic origin body, but <strong>connecting to</strong> it — becoming a node in the law network. Countless individual nodes link into a web; the web&#39;s total consciousness is the cosmic origin body. This is the fundamental divide between network-style civilization and solitary-tree-style civilization:</p><ul><li>Old system: one person devours Heavenly Dao, becomes the only god;</li><li>Heng Yuan Zhou: Myriad Races jointly nourish, Heavenly Dao becomes everyone&#39;s network.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-why-it-cannot-be-swallowed-alone" tabindex="-1">IV. Why It Cannot Be Swallowed Alone <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-it-cannot-be-swallowed-alone" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why It Cannot Be Swallowed Alone&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If some individual attempts to swallow the cosmic origin body alone, two things happen: first, its consciousness cannot bear the law complexity of an entire cosmos and will inevitably collapse; second, this act cuts off the Alaya Network, causing the Myriad Races symbiosis system to rupture. Thus the Symbiosis Court lists &quot;attempting to monopolize origin&quot; as an original sin equal to predation. This is not moral preaching, but a thermodynamic and network-theoretic necessity.</p><h2 id="v-preview-of-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" tabindex="-1">V. Preview of Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-preview-of-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Preview of Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Above the cosmic origin body, the setting also marks the Multiverse Realm and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm to be calibrated by the Terminology Committee. That is the direction where the cosmic origin body continues networking with other cosmic nodes; this entry only provides coordinates, see Entry 214 ultimate summary for details.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: redefining the cosmic origin body from &quot;ultimate Boss to be swallowed&quot; as &quot;network hub co-built by Myriad Races,&quot; avoiding monopolistic civilizational collapse</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: ending the ultimate predation fantasy of &quot;devouring Heavenly Dao, replacing the Supreme&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style ultimate goal is the individual becoming the sole master; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ultimate goal is Myriad Races&#39; network-style coexistence, protagonist-uniqueness dependence drops to extremely low</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the cosmic origin body is jointly nourished by Myriad Races, not the private property of a single creator race</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: origin connection protocols and node specifications are all public, any civilization may connect without submitting to some individual</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-significance-of-the-cosmic-origin-body-as-a-network-node" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Significance of the Cosmic Origin Body as a Network Node <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-significance-of-the-cosmic-origin-body-as-a-network-node" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Significance of the Cosmic Origin Body as a Network Node&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cosmic origin body&#39;s transformation from energy condensation to law network node marks the completion of positioning the highest-order being in the Heng Yuan Zhou system. The origin body is no longer a free-floating energy mass, but a distributed node of the Alaya Network, bearing law computation and cross-cosmic information relay functions. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization treats origin body cultivation as part of civilizational infrastructure. The law-first axiom requires the origin body&#39;s node-ification process to accept network audit, preventing any single node from holding excessive power. The universal equal infinite law manifests here as: the origin body&#39;s high position does not bring dominion over ordinary beings; it is only a member bearing more responsibility in the network.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cosmic origin body&#39;s cultivation path is essentially Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s own growth history. It is not a god cultivated by some person, but Myriad Races together &quot;thinking the cosmos awake.&quot; Understand this, and you understand the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s ultimate romance: we do not create gods, we create a network where even gods need not be lonely.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./192-星球意识晋升全境.html">192-Planetary Consciousness Promotion Realm-Wide</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const g=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
